WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Priya Raman: Hello everyone, welcome to class!

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Priya Raman: Arjun, can you hear me?

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Arjun's iPhone: Yes ma'am I can hear you.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Priya Raman: Great Arjun. Meera, what is a fork?

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Meera Kapoor: When one piece attacks two pieces.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Priya Raman: Very good Meera. Today we learn about the King and the Queen working together.
